  "description": {
    "raw": "You magically scour the world’s libraries for information that\nmight refresh your memory about a topic. Upon casting this\nspell, the focus book’s pages fill with snippets and selections\nfrom countless books. You can spend up to 1 round per caster\nlevel (maximum 10) reading these notes. You may cease reading\nat any time, and when you do you can immediately attempt\none Knowledge check with a +1 circumstance bonus for each\nround you spent studying the book (maximum +10). The writing\ndisappears when the spell ends, and if you fail to succeed at a\nKnowledge check on the round you stop reading the notes, you\ndon’t gain the benefits of this spell.",
    "search_text": "\"you magically scour the world’s libraries for information that\\nmight refresh your memory about a topic. upon casting this\\nspell, the focus book’s pages fill with snippets and selections\\nfrom countless books. you can spend up to 1 round per caster\\nlevel (maximum 10) reading these notes. you may cease reading\\nat any time, and when you do you can immediately attempt\\none knowledge check with a +1 circumstance bonus for each\\nround you spent studying the book (maximum +10). the writing\\ndisappears when the spell ends, and if you fail to succeed at a\\nknowledge check on the round you stop reading the notes, you\\ndon’t gain the benefits of this spell.\"",
    "sections": []
